# ---- Copyrighted paper material -------------------------------------------------
# Paper PDFs, supplementary documents, figure images and full-text extractions
# must never be committed (see core/test/papers/README.md). Keep them locally
# in each paper's assets/ folder (ignored as a whole). Only the transcribed
# numbers (reference_values.csv), our own READMEs/tests and the digitised curves
# in core/data/ belong in the repository.
# Extensionless files (e.g. a PDF saved without its suffix) under papers/:
# ignore every name without a dot, then re-include dotted names and directories.
core/test/papers/**/[!.]*
!core/test/papers/**/*.*
!core/test/papers/**/
core/test/papers/**/assets/
core/test/papers/**/*.pdf
core/test/papers/**/*.PDF
core/test/papers/**/*.docx
core/test/papers/**/*.doc
core/test/papers/**/*.xlsx
core/test/papers/**/*.xls
core/test/papers/**/*.pptx
core/test/papers/**/*.epub
core/test/papers/**/*.png
core/test/papers/**/*.jpg
core/test/papers/**/*_artifacts/
